+ // its format (iOS 27: the app switcher's snapshots, BGR10_XR IOSurfaces): the pipeline as the descriptor asked for those
+ // colors, as metal2vulkan refuses a state color of another size than the pass's (AttachmentFormat).
+ if(const unsigned keep=pipeline.dexrColors & self.extendedRangeColors) {
